  "MCA01-V12-P": "the pure census is C's table_index_count (pub(super) in row_preflight, 0 on every actual MCA01 row); A's Unsupported needs a RowPreflightContext only C's preflight builds, and consumers §8.4 forbids a context factory; no independent Catalog-leaf author exists.",
  "MCA05-V16..V18 (frame)": "C has no frame-share admission: the Row Begin and statement issue need their targets resident without LOAD and the preflight LOADs with a protected list. Varying the fixture pool changes the total, which consumers §9 forbids. Observed on this fixture (dev, not PASS): 9-10 frames Begin Unchanged (Prepare, MissingTarget), 11 statement issue Unchanged (Census, MissingTarget), 12 and 13 the full Reserve-Forward-failed statement-full abort."
 },
